	 (property "Voltage rating" ">=10V" (at 219.71 394.97 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes))) (property "Purpose" "VCAP3 high-frequency bypass parallel to retained 1uF, ADS1298 Figure106" (at 219.71 394.97 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes))) (property "Qualification" "Qualify effective C at approximately5.2V; internal node must not power loads" (at 219.71 394.97 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes))))
(text "Reference / internal bypass nodes: separate per ADC; never join VCAPs.\nVREFP: 10uF || 100nF to VREFN/GND; enable internal 2.4V reference.\nVCAP1=22uF, VCAP2=1uF, VCAP3=1uF || 100nF, VCAP4=1uF.\nVCAP3 is about5.2V on3.3V supply: >=10V rated, bias-qualified parts." (at 20.32 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "529c420e-dae7-588d-af55-ea7fd54efb71"))
(text "Input pairs: 2k per leg (0.1%, >=0.1W), 620pF to GND (C0G,1%).\nPreserved RC topology; no added human-contact protection.\nUnused PACE/RLDIN17/18/62 tied to AVDD: keep PACE/rerouting OFF.\nRLDREF/RLDINV/RLDOUT/WCT unconnected; keep RLD/WCT OFF.\nGPIO1-4, DAISY_IN and RESV1 grounded; configure GPIO1-4 as inputs." (at 20.32 425.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9eb5d86f-7173-5813-b8aa-f1b5d0d08178"))
(text "ADS1298 #2 / channels 9-16" (at 309.88 44.45 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "73cf12da-c291-53ae-a0ee-5b1a529052dc"))
