(text "Use a complete stock DevKitC-1, not a bare module.\nLaptop USB -> onboard regulator -> 3V3 header pins1/2.\nNo battery, external regulator or other3V3 source.\n5V and CHIP_PU header branches have no carrier connection;\nonboard USB, reset, boot and UART circuits remain in DevKit." (at 619.76 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9fd4233e-2581-523e-8701-a9310f22a06b"))
