(text "Shared communication / startup (F06/F09/F18)" (at 619.76 214.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7bdd1fb-3114-53c2-946a-ceff9777d3dc"))
(text "Direct MOSI=GPIO11; SCLK=GPIO12; MISO=GPIO40.\nCS1=GPIO21 / CS2=GPIO39: HIGH at boot; select ONE ADC only.\nDOUT is high-Z with CS HIGH (TI9.4.2.1). No external MISO gate.\nDRDY1=GPIO41 / DRDY2=GPIO42, input-only, pulls disabled.\nUse GPIO mux, disable pad JTAG; verify eFuses before assembly.\nGPIO3 HIGH selects USB JTAG only in strap-controlled modes." (at 619.76 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a507ae08-bf23-51e5-8796-68631b7105d0"))
(text "START=GPIO8; RESET=GPIO6; PWDN=GPIO7.\n10k pulldowns retain LOW while MCU high-Z (also DIN/SCLK).\nBoot/warm reset: initialize LOW forward latches; CS both HIGH.\nRelease PWDN; wait U1POR/VCAP1>1.1V; pulse shared RESET,\nthen hold RESET HIGH. SDATAC/configure U1 with CLK_EN=1.\nU1CLKSEL=HIGH, U2CLKSEL=LOW; U1CLK drives both CLK pins.\nWait U2POR on valid clock; use CS2-only SPI RESET command.\nKeep shared RESET HIGH, or restart entire clock initialization!\nConfigure both: 2.4V reference enable/settle/readback, then START.\nPOR >=2^18 clocks per ADC; observe TI11.1 timing.\nTI low-input ramp wording vs CS pullups needs bench review." (at 619.76 350.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7da7ce11-1069-5ecb-8090-28d9ee61cb42"))
(text "Acquisition / wireless target (firmware required)" (at 619.76 410.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "43493de1-e63c-5e51-b2cf-431d99f28840"))
(text "HR mode2kSPS nominal: CONFIG1 HR=1, DR=100, both ADCs.\n2 x (24-bit status +8x24-bit data) =54 bytes/sample pair.\n2k pairs/s =108kB/s;2MHz SPI takes216us of each500us.\nSPI mode1, short traces; verify measured loaded logic/edges.\nExample Wi-Fi:10 pairs +16B header/UDP =116.8kB/s at IP layer.\nUse SPI DMA, separate Wi-Fi task, ring buffer, sequence IDs.\nBounded RF outages need buffering/retry; no lossless claim tested." (at 619.76 421.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "257424f0-afde-58c7-9b3e-716170ef9776"))
(text "Electrical limits / bench prerequisites" (at 20.32 474.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.9 1.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d434349d-60bf-5843-8e4d-fa80fbf5479e"))
(text "Power budget NOT verified: identify fitted DevKit/regulator, USB current authorization, 3V3 droop, capacitor stability and temperature.\nReference DevKit v1.1 regulator: SGM2212,800mA rating; not a guaranteed available header current. 500mA USB has no full worst-case margin.\nWi-Fi355mA is a characterized TX peak at3.3V/25C, not a complete-system maximum. No external power source may join the3V3 rail.\nNo external analog source before rails are valid. Begin with ADC internal-short/test mux, then a grounded simulator near1.65V common mode.\nAt gain6 and2.4V reference: |VD|<0.4V and0.2+G|VD|/2<VCM<3.3-0.2-G|VD|/2. Keep each input within rails;2k is not a clamp.\nDirect ESP->ADS VIH/VOH limits meet only at0.8xVDD; loaded HIGH margin/startup ramps require scope checks. Keep RF returns away from ADC loops.\nF07/F08 body bias, wearer protection and isolation remain unimplemented. Bench power-up requires the checks in reviews_v1.4/implementation.md." (at 20.32 486.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e45bf67f-423f-5f09-8a6f-f95878562d44"))
